{"sections":[{"slug":"量子场论","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"量子场论"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">量子场论</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“量子场论”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<blockquote>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">丁徐祉晗</span> 2023 <span lang=\"zh\">年</span> 3 <span lang=\"zh\">月</span> 30 <span lang=\"zh\">日在院长讨论班讲的</span>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">多数</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">但不是全部</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">场论可由</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Lagrange量","text":"Lagrange <span lang=\"zh\">量</span>"}},{"Plain":" (Lagrange <span lang=\"zh\">密度</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">描述</span>. Ostrogradsky <span lang=\"zh\">条件说</span> Lagrange <span lang=\"zh\">量不包含坐标的高于一阶的导数</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">我们考虑</span> Lorentz <span lang=\"zh\">流形</span> $M$, <span lang=\"zh\">如</span> $\\mathbb{R}^{3,1}$. <strong><span lang=\"zh\">场</span></strong> (field) $\\phi$ <span lang=\"zh\">是某个纤维丛</span> $E\\to M$ <span lang=\"zh\">的截面</span>, $E$ <span lang=\"zh\">上有</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Lorentz群","text":"Lorentz <span lang=\"zh\">群</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">作用</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">此时我们希望</span> $\\mathcal L$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> Lorentz <span lang=\"zh\">不变的</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">作用量</span>\n$$\r\nS = \\int d^4 x \\mathcal L(\\phi,\\partial_\\mu\\phi)\r\n$$</p>\n<p>$$\r\n\\mathcal L = -m^2 \\phi^\\dagger \\phi + \\partial _\\mu \\phi^\\dagger  \\partial ^\\mu \\phi\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}}]}